WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.086
Organic synthesis begins with an intended structure. A spectrum

00:00:05.086 --> 00:00:09.621
and an isolated sample decide what the reaction actually yielded.

00:00:15.175 --> 00:00:20.365
The UREP research investigated imidazopyridine chemistry, using

00:00:20.365 --> 00:00:25.554
synthetic strategies and characterization to develop candidate heterocycles.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.211
Chemical purity and structural assignment must

00:00:35.211 --> 00:00:38.621
precede confidence in a biological screening result.

00:00:43.092 --> 00:00:47.764
Cytotoxicity readouts are starting points for investigating molecular

00:00:47.764 --> 00:00:52.437
activity; they cannot demonstrate anticancer efficacy in a patient.

00:00:58.092 --> 00:01:02.030
The project record should preserve which compounds were made,

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:05.969
what assays were performed, and which conclusions remain untested.

00:01:10.883 --> 00:01:15.113
The grant-supported heterocycle work follows the distance between designing

00:01:15.113 --> 00:01:19.342
a molecule, identifying it, and knowing whether it matters.
